<title>USA: Infosafe Systems Q2 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Infosafe Systems Q2 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.16     loss	 $0.23</p>
<p> Net	   loss	   577     loss	   771</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,546		    3,410</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said the second quarter period ended on January 31.</p>
<p>Net loss for the second quarter of 1996 included a non-recurring cost for the launch and marketing of the company's first product.</p>
<p>The company was not available to comment on its figures for the first six months of the year for 1996 or 1995 or on the amount of the non-recurring cost in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
</text>
